                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I completely agree with Ron that insurance companies play a role in bringing up our high health care costs. The United States spends the most amount of money on health care out of any country, yet we don\u2019t get the results we deserve.\n\nI will fight to make sure this government shutdown fight does not jack up insurance costs any more for those in our district.",
