                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "In 2026, there's a higher risk that more Americans will go uninsured. Medicare Part B premiums will increase by almost 10% and potentially risk the health care coverage of 64 million Medicare recipients. ACA marketplace coverage will also increase drastically in 2026, risking the health care coverage for millions more Americans. Leaving Americans uninsured damages the entire system, causing a ripple effect through the health care market.",
