                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "King County has approved a new budget allocating more than $225 million for public safety and criminal justice, as well as over $55 million for housing and homelessness services. By providing more behavioral health programs and housing transition initiatives, we give our neighbors a better chance .\n\nhttps://t.co/ldFhz2oHCj",
