                "text": "Today, I introduced the Community Health Access Through Resilient Grid Energy (CHARGE) Act alongside @RepDavidValadao. This bipartisan legislation would create funding for solar energy systems and battery storage technologies at community health clinics, helping to maintain operations during emergencies. Community health centers are the backbone of care in undeserved communities, and it's important we keep these centers open, protect patients, and strengthen energy resilience.",
