                "text": "I was proud to stand with members of the Washington state delegation to demand ICE provide answers about unacceptable conditions at the Northwest ICE Processing Center in Tacoma. I am deeply concerned by reports that the facility lacks medical services, access to legal counsel, and basic necessities for its inmates, and oftentimes faces overcrowding.\u00a0This administration is failing to meet their fundamental moral and legal obligation to NWIPC's detainees, violating their dignity. No one in our state should live under these conditions.",
